title: "Anatomy of a Super-App Mobile Wallet: Comprehensive Evidence-Bounded Static Reverse Engineering of ZaloPay 11.17.0"
message: "If you cite this research monograph, dataset, or programmatic documentary, please use the metadata below."
type: software
