license: MIT
abstract: >-
  An exhaustive, evidence-bounded, non-executing static reverse-engineering study
  of all 6,832 files across the multi-layer archive hierarchy of ZaloPay 11.17.0
  (vn.com.vng.zalopay, versionCode 1102758, targetSdk 36), combining the
  morluto/rea (rea-agents 6.10.1) evidence framework with deterministic DEX,
  ARSC, ELF32, and ML/JS-bridge telemetry.
